description:
## Goal

Render clause-coverage warnings from typed reachable failure evidence so each diagnostic names an actual uncovered demanded input and offers a construct-correct remedy.

## Correct premise

After fz-kdt.36.1 and fz-kdt.36.2, coverage is never checked against an invented undeclared-`any` or whole-contract domain. A warning exists only because a demanded function-head or local-dispatch input row can reach `Dispatch Fail`.

## Strategy

Extend the authoritative typed reachability/evidence value only as far as needed to retain a canonical failure witness or failure row. Preserve argument correlation and branch-local refinements. Never reconstruct a witness from syntax, union parameter columns, enumerate type products, expose raw `Ty` ids, or choose by arrival/source/hash/display order.

Warning identity remains the typed semantic site from fz-kdt.36.1/.2. Witness is evidence value; source span and prose are provenance/presentation. When several ordinary contributors support one site, choose the canonical witness with the authoritative semantic comparator over denotations. Equal evidence preserves retained snapshot allocation/generation and wakes nobody.

## TDD

Prove:

- a function-head warning names the reachable uncovered argument row and escaping parameter position/shape;
- `case` and `with else` warnings name the reachable uncovered subject;
- correlated tuple/list rows remain correlated;
- guarded fallthrough is explained as a possible guard-false path when appropriate;
- function help uses function-clause syntax and distinguishes fixing the caller/domain from deliberately adding a final clause;
- `case`/`with` help uses correct arm syntax;
- quicksort remains warning-free and receives no invented missing-spec advice;
- competing witnesses select the same semantic minimum across process, FIFO/LIFO, hash seed, and stress permutation;
- location-only replacement changes only provenance and retained diagnostic presentation;
- equal witness reproduction preserves fact/product allocation and generation.

## Removal

Delete generic every-input wording, unconditional wildcard help, obsolete undeclared-domain guidance, display-string ordering, witness reconstruction helpers, and old diagnostics goldens. Update diagnostic, pattern-matching, type-ordering, and user-facing guides in the same commit. Full focused, deterministic, fixture, CLI, formatting, check, and strict-Clippy gates pass.
